sn1.20:25.1 starts: The Blessed One:
sn1.20:25.2 starts: He cut off craving here for name-and-form.
sn1.20:25.3 starts: Though devas and humans search for him
sn1.20:25.4 starts: Here and beyond, in the heavens and all
sn1.20:25.5 starts: They do not find the one whose knots
sn1.20:25.6 starts: The one untroubled, free of longing.
