sn1.27:2.1 starts: “Where water, earth, fire, and air,
sn1.27:2.2 starts: Do not gain a footing:
sn1.29:1.3 starts: Born from a bog, O great hero!
sn1.29:1.4 starts: How does one escape from it?”
